WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.379 --> 00:00:10.780
We have a huge welfare state that's been built
up over the last 50 years, and we can get

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:16.570
rid of it. Take all the money that we currently
spend on transfers from one American to another

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:21.590
American, whether they are for people on welfare,
or whether they're for retirees, whether they're

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:28.779
for medical care, take all that money, convert
into a universal basic income that starts

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:34.540
when someone turns 21 and continues until
they die, which gives them every year $10,000

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:40.900
of disposable income, and put their lives
back in their hands. The key to making this

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:47.070
work is not getting enough money. We already
spent plenty of money to do this. The key

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:52.640
in understanding why it would work and how
it would work is that it's just not that you

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:59.720
as an individual have $10,000, everybody else
does too. And the opportunities this opens

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:04.460
up for people to cooperate, to solve their
problems, and the problems of their families

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:12.090
and their communities will be unparalleled.

